Hello,

Barnyard Brights supplies farm-theme drinkware. Farm and country style is very popular in the US now. Our offer is below. Prices in RMB, EXW Taizhou, excluding VAT. Photos of 2 items attached.

1. TK998GCER226 - Hillside Pasture Perfect Cup "Farm Cow", 17 oz
   Ceramic (stoneware) cup, PP lid with silicone seal. Size 7 x 5.24 x 3.55 in, weight 1.21 lb (0.55 kg).
   Dishwasher safe, top rack. Artwork EveArt. Made in China.
   Price RMB 36.60 / pc, MOQ 600 pcs (50 cartons), production 35 days, shipping to US port about 40 days.

2. 3SSHD035D - Rise & Shine Chicken Canyon Cup, 40 oz, double wall stainless steel with straw
   Size 4.05 x 5.9 x 10.7 in, weight 1.1 lb (0.5 kg). Stainless steel body, PP lid, ABS straw. Colour blue.
   Hand wash only. Packed in colour box with window. Artwork EveArt. Made in China.
   Price RMB 54.70 / pc, MOQ 1,200 pcs, production 35 days, shipping about 40 days.

3. P5300 - Animal Jokes Canyon Cup, Easy Scan display program, assorted designs
   Price RMB 21.00 / pc, MOQ 2,000 pcs, production 40 days, shipping about 30 days.
   More details on our website.

Waiting for your order.
Kevin Xu
Barnyard Brights Trading Co. | Taizhou, Zhejiang

